<body>
    <h1>AIP-72:  Metadata Integration into Vision</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p><span class=3D"confluence-jim-macro jira-issue" data-jira-key=3D=
"AIP-72"> <a href=3D"https://perifery.atlassian.net/browse/AIP-72?src=3Dcon=
fmacro" class=3D"jira-issue-key">AIP-72</a> </span></p>
<h1 id=3D"AIP-72:MetadataIntegrationintoVision-Overview">Overview</h1>
<p>This design document outlines the integration of the SWARM service with =
the Notification API module to generate metadata sidecar files as described=
 in the provided documentation. The goal is to enhance the Notification API=
's components (transcribe, summarize, object-detection, and face-recognitio=
n) to create and manage these sidecar files in S3 storage.</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>The metadata sidecar files will always be stored in a path starting with=
 <code>.metadata</code>.</p></li>
<li>
<p>The <code>appId</code> should be configurable but default to "ai-plus".<=
/p></li>
<li>
<p>The <code>appCategory</code> should be configurable but default to the c=
omponent name of the Notification API.</p></li>
<li>
<p>The sidecar file name should be the original file's key with ".metadata.=
json" appended.</p></li>
</ul>
<h1 id=3D"AIP-72:MetadataIntegrationintoVision-SystemArchitecture">System A=
rchitecture</h1>
<h2 id=3D"AIP-72:MetadataIntegrationintoVision-NotificationAPI"><strong>Not=
ification API</strong></h2>
<p>The Notification API will be the component that generates the sidecar in=
formation for Vision. This will be a configuration flag</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">config.=
visionMetadata =3D true</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p>The four utilities will output the metadata files. In the case of the Tr=
anscribe &amp; Summarize, we will have two metadata files =E2=80=93 transcr=
ibe and summarize.</p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>Transcribe</p></li>
<li>
<p>Summarize</p></li>
<li>
<p>Object Detection</p></li>
<li>
<p>Face Recognition</p></li>
<li>
<p>Translate</p></li>
</ol>
<h3 id=3D"AIP-72:MetadataIntegrationintoVision-Configuration">Configuration=
</h3>
<p>We will add the following configurable parameters to the Notification AP=
I:</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: py; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">METADATA_=
APP_ID =3D os.getenv("METADATA_APP_ID", "ai-plus")
METADATA_PATH_PREFIX =3D ".metadata"</pre>
</div>
</div>
<h3 id=3D"AIP-72:MetadataIntegrationintoVision-MetadataSidecarGenerator">Me=
tadata Sidecar Generator</h3>
<p>We will create a new class <code>MetadataSidecarGenerator</code> with th=
e following methods:</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: py; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">class Met=
adataSidecarGenerator:
    def __init__(self, s3_client, bucket_name, app_id=3DMETADATA_APP_ID):
        self.s3_client =3D s3_client
        self.bucket_name =3D bucket_name
        self.app_id =3D app_id

    def generate_sidecar_key(self, original_key, app_category):
        return f"{METADATA_PATH_PREFIX}/{self.app_id}/{app_category}/{origi=
nal_key}.metadata.json"

    def create_sidecar_file(self, original_key, app_category, metadata):
        sidecar_key =3D self.generate_sidecar_key(original_key, app_categor=
y)
        metadata_json =3D json.dumps(metadata, indent=3D2)
        self.s3_client.put_object(
            Bucket=3Dself.bucket_name,
            Key=3Dsidecar_key,
            Body=3Dmetadata_json,
            ContentType=3D"application/json"
        )
        return sidecar_key</pre>
</div>
</div>
<h3 id=3D"AIP-72:MetadataIntegrationintoVision-IntegrationwithNotificationA=
PIComponents">Integration with Notification API Components</h3>
<p>We will modify each Notification API component to use a <code>MetadataSi=
decarGenerator</code>instance =E2=80=93 or instances, in the Transcribe/Sum=
marize case:</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: py; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">class Not=
ificationAPIComponent:
    def __init__(self, s3_client, bucket_name):
        self.s3_client =3D s3_client
        self.bucket_name =3D bucket_name
        self.metadata_generator =3D MetadataSidecarGenerator(s3_client, buc=
ket_name)

    def process_file(self, file_key):
        # Existing processing logic
        result =3D self.perform_processing(file_key)

        # Generate metadata sidecar file
        metadata =3D self.format_metadata(result)
        sidecar_key =3D self.metadata_generator.create_sidecar_file(
            file_key,
            self.__class__.__name__.lower(),  # Use component name as app_c=
ategory
            metadata
        )

        return result, sidecar_key

    def format_metadata(self, result):
        # Format the result into the desired metadata structure
        # This method should be implemented by each component
        raise NotImplementedError</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p></p>
<p>For the Transcribe &amp; Summarize piece, we will output two pieces of m=
etadata =E2=80=93 the summary and the transcription.</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: py; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">class Sum=
marizeComponent(NotificationAPIComponent):
    def perform_processing(self, file_key):
        # Existing summarization logic
        pass

    def format_metadata(self, result):
        return {
            "summary": result["summary"],
            "keywords": result["keywords"]
        }</pre>
</div>
</div>
<h3 id=3D"AIP-72:MetadataIntegrationintoVision-SWARMServiceIntegration">SWA=
RM Service Integration</h3>
<p>Modify the <code>SwarmService</code> class to work with the new metadata=
 sidecar files:</p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>Update the <code>handleNewFile</code> method to check for existing metad=
ata sidecar files.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Modify the <code>processItem</code> method to call the appropriate Notif=
ication API component and generate the metadata sidecar file.</p></li>
</ol>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: py; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">class Swa=
rmService:
    # ... existing code ...

    async def handleNewFile(self, swarm_bucket, key):
        # ... existing code ...
        metadata_generator =3D MetadataSidecarGenerator(self.s3.client, swa=
rm_bucket.bucket)
        sidecar_key =3D metadata_generator.generate_sidecar_key(key, swarm_=
bucket.processor.lower())
       =20
        if self.s3.client.head_object(Bucket=3Dswarm_bucket.bucket, Key=3Ds=
idecar_key):
            raise Exception(f"Metadata sidecar file already exists for {key=
}")
       =20
        # ... rest of the existing code ...

    def processItem(self, bucket_item_id, task_job_id):
        # ... existing code ...
        component =3D self.get_notification_api_component(processor)
        result, sidecar_key =3D component.process_file(bucket_item.file_key=
)
       =20
        # Update the bucket item with the sidecar file information
        SwarmBucketItemDAL.update(
            db_session,
            bucket_item.id,
            {"metadata_sidecar_key": sidecar_key}
        )
        # ... rest of the existing code ...</pre>
</div>
</div>
<h1 id=3D"AIP-72:MetadataIntegrationintoVision-Vision">Vision</h1>
<p>Metadata files are located in the same bucket as the original objects. E=
ach application has a dedicated and well-defined path for uploading sidecar=
 metadata files. This path runs parallel to the original object but include=
s an app-specific prefix and file-format suffix. Such a structure offers se=
veral advantages. First, it allows for grouping metadata sidecar files by v=
endor and app category. Second, it provides support for external apps via d=
rop-in points. Lastly, it enables control of storage access per vendor or a=
pplication using bucket policies for paths. This approach ensures efficient=
 organization and management of metadata while maintaining flexibility and =
security.</p>
<p><strong>Examples</strong></p>
<p></p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper=
 confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image i=
mage-center" alt=3D"Screenshot 2024-08-23 at 18.57.44.png" width=3D"468" lo=
ading=3D"lazy" src=3D"4ad98c83820626a0839bfd7ef767c93cd7c9bb48cd0de355e8649=
ce765edd0ca" data-image-src=3D"https://perifery.atlassian.net/wiki/download=
/attachments/3774218249/Screenshot%202024-08-23%20at%2018.57.44.png?version=
=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1725051679177&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2=
" data-height=3D"607" data-width=3D"821" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0=
" data-linked-resource-id=3D"3774578703" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1"=
 data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alia=
s=3D"Screenshot 2024-08-23 at 18.57.44.png" data-base-url=3D"https://perife=
ry.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data=
-linked-resource-container-id=3D"3774218249" data-linked-resource-container=
-version=3D"5" data-media-id=3D"bacb7157-e1c3-47cd-994f-9081eb97a7cc" data-=
media-type=3D"file" height=3D"346"></span>
<p><strong>Limitations</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Proposed prefix reduces maximum length of a key for original object i.e.=
 objects with very long keys e.g. 1024 bytes will not be capable of having =
side-car metadata files.&nbsp;<br>
Maximum length of a key is backend-storage specific.</p></li>
<li>
<p>complications when original object is deleted<br>
We should delete metadata files generated internally.<br>
If customer applications are dropping-in metadata files, a decision needs t=
o be made what to do about those i.e. delete metadata automatically vs leav=
e it to the application. Configuration per customer/bucket?</p></li>
<li>
<p>asynchronous nature means original objects may be overwritten/deleted be=
fore metadata processing takes place</p></li>
<li>
<p>automatic deletion of metadata files may cause race-condition when origi=
nal object is re-uploaded. This can be mitigated by comparing the creation =
time of the original and metadata files</p></li>
</ul>
<p></p>
<h1 id=3D"AIP-72:MetadataIntegrationintoVision-Samples"><strong>Samples</st=
rong></h1>
<h2 id=3D"AIP-72:MetadataIntegrationintoVision-Summarize">Summarize</h2>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">{
&nbsp;&nbsp;"summary":&nbsp;"This&nbsp;video&nbsp;discusses&nbsp;the&nbsp;i=
mpact&nbsp;of&nbsp;climate&nbsp;change&nbsp;on&nbsp;global&nbsp;ecosystems,=
&nbsp;focusing&nbsp;on&nbsp;rising&nbsp;sea&nbsp;levels&nbsp;and&nbsp;extre=
me&nbsp;weather&nbsp;events.",
&nbsp;&nbsp;"keywords":&nbsp;"climate&nbsp;change,&nbsp;sea&nbsp;level&nbsp=
;rise,&nbsp;extreme&nbsp;weather,&nbsp;ecosystems,&nbsp;global&nbsp;warming=
"
}</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p></p>
<h2 id=3D"AIP-72:MetadataIntegrationintoVision-Transcribe">Transcribe</h2>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">{
  "transcription": "Loren episum etc..."
}</pre>
</div>
</div>
<h2 id=3D"AIP-72:MetadataIntegrationintoVision-ObjectDetection">Object Dete=
ction</h2>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">{
&nbsp;&nbsp;"time-based-metadata":&nbsp;[
